---
/**
 * Section split image 01: A section heading with a button over body text beside an image.
 *
 * @block content
 * @order 13
 */
import Section from '../../components/Section/Section.astro'
import SectionHeader from '../../components/SectionHeader/SectionHeader.astro'
import Prose from '../../components/Prose/Prose.astro'
import Image from '../../components/Image/Image.astro'
import Button from '../../components/Button/Button.astro'
---

<Section spacing="large">
  <SectionHeader eyebrow="Why we're different" heading="We help teams ship work they are proud of" description="Shared parts, written rules and a strict build: less arguing about buttons, more time on the product." class="mb-12">
    <Button slot="actions" href="#" size="large">Get started</Button>
  </SectionHeader>
  <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <Prose>
      <p>Most teams start a design system after the third button that looks almost, but not quite, like the other two. The cost is rarely the button; it is the conversation every time someone has to choose.</p>
      <p>A system turns those conversations into decisions made once, written down where people work, and checked by the build.</p>
    </Prose>
    <Image src="https://picsum.photos/seed/apogee-content-40/1200/800" alt="" width={1200} height={800} fit="cover" radius="xl" class="aspect-[3/2] w-full" />
  </div>
</Section>
